        "section_id": "autumn-hero",
        "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  Autumn hero (temporary Custom Liquid version).\n  Uses the theme's banner, heading, text and button classes, so fonts, sizes,\n  button styles and hover effects come from the theme.\n  Colours come from THIS section's settings (Text = #ffffff,\n  Button background = #ffffff, Button text = #171717).\n  Only custom CSS: the full-bleed escape and the crossfade.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- liquid\n  assign slide_files = '20260825-Stetten-Wilson-218.jpg,20260825-Stetten-Wilson-219.jpg,20260825-Stetten-Wilson-112.jpg,20260825-Stetten-Wilson-314.jpg,20260825-Stetten-Wilson-245.jpg' | split: ','\n  assign hold = 10\n  assign total = hold | times: slide_files.size\n-%}\n\n<style>\n  /* Let this one section run edge to edge. */\n  #autumn-hero > .page-width {\n    max-width: none;\n    padding-inline: 0;\n  }\n  #autumn-hero .crossfade__slide {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    opacity: 0;\n    animation: autumnHeroFade {{ total }}s ease-in-out infinite;\n  }\n  #autumn-hero .crossfade__slide img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  /* 50s cycle: each slide holds 10s, fades over 2s. Negative delays start\n     slide 1 already visible, so there is no black screen on load. */\n  @keyframes autumnHeroFade {\n    0%   { opacity: 1 }\n    20%  { opacity: 1 }\n    24%  { opacity: 0 }\n    96%  { opacity: 0 }\n    100% { opacity: 1 }\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    #autumn-hero .crossfade__slide { animation: none; }\n    #autumn-hero .crossfade__slide:first-child { opacity: 1; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"banner media--100vh mobile:media--600px relative\" style=\"--color-overlay: 0 0 0; --overlay-opacity: 0.3;\">\n  <div class=\"banner__media block w-full h-full overflow-hidden relative\">\n    {%- for file in slide_files -%}\n      {%- assign slide = images[file] -%}\n      {%- if slide != blank -%}\n        {%- liquid\n          assign slide_delay = hold | times: forloop.index0 | minus: total\n          if forloop.first\n            assign img_loading = 'eager'\n            assign img_priority = 'high'\n          else\n            assign img_loading = 'lazy'\n            assign img_priority = 'auto'\n          endif\n        -%}\n        <div class=\"crossfade__slide\" style=\"animation-delay: {{ slide_delay }}s;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          {{- slide | image_url: width: 3200 | image_tag: loading: img_loading, fetchpriority: img_priority, sizes: '100vw', widths: '400,600,800,1000,1200,1600,2000,2400,3200', alt: '' -}}\n        </div>\n      {%- endif -%}\n    {%- endfor -%}\n  </div>\n\n  <span class=\"banner__overlay absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none\"></span>\n\n  <div class=\"banner__content overflow-hidden absolute z-1 top-0 left-0 w-full h-full\">\n    <div class=\"page-width w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center md:items-center md:justify-center\">\n      <div class=\"banner__box banner__box--medium text-center md:text-center\">\n        <h2 class=\"banner__title heading leading-none title-md\">Four fall dinners, each under an hour</h2>\n        <div class=\"rte leading-normal body subtext-md\">\n          <p>A seasonal menu from Chef Miriam Thom &mdash; whole roasted trout, butter pumpkin shrimp, cider-poached steelhead and crisp-skinned branzino. Every recipe is on this page, with the seafood a click away.</p>\n        </div>\n        <a class=\"button button--primary button--md button--fixed\" href=\"#autumn-box\" is=\"hover-link\">\n          <span class=\"btn-fill\" data-fill></span>\n          <span class=\"btn-text\">Shop the Autumn Box</span>\n        </a>\n        <a class=\"button button--secondary button--md button--fixed\" href=\"#autumn-recipes\" is=\"hover-link\">\n          <span class=\"btn-fill\" data-fill></span>\n          <span class=\"btn-text\">Explore the recipes</span>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
