      "settings": {
        "section_id": "autumn-recipes",
        "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  Autumn recipe cards (temporary Custom Liquid version).\n  Headings, text, badges, buttons and links use the theme's own classes.\n  Every colour, radius and spacing value below is a theme variable, so it\n  follows Theme settings and this section's colour pickers.\n  Only layout (grid, card structure, image swap on hover) is custom.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n<style>\n  .sea-rx__head { max-width: 62ch; margin-block-end: var(--sp-8); }\n\n  .sea-rx__grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: clamp(var(--sp-4), 1.5vw, var(--sp-6));\n  }\n  .sea-rx__card {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: rgb(var(--color-foreground) / 0.03);\n    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-border));\n    border-radius: var(--rounded-block);\n  }\n  .sea-rx__media {\n    position: relative;\n    margin: 0;\n    aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: rgb(var(--color-placeholder));\n  }\n  .sea-rx__media img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    display: block;\n    transition: opacity var(--animation-primary, .45s ease);\n  }\n  .sea-rx__media img.is-hover { position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: 0; }\n  .sea-rx__card:hover .sea-rx__media img.is-hover,\n  .sea-rx__card:focus-within .sea-rx__media img.is-hover { opacity: 1; }\n\n  .sea-rx__body {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    gap: var(--sp-3);\n    padding: var(--sp-5) var(--sp-6) var(--sp-6);\n  }\n  .sea-rx__meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--sp-1d5) var(--sp-2d5); margin: 0; }\n  /* Theme badge, inverted to a light pill so four of them don't shout. */\n  .sea-rx__meta .badge {\n    --badge-background: rgb(var(--color-background));\n    --badge-foreground: rgb(var(--color-foreground) / 0.75);\n    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-border));\n  }\n  .sea-rx__note { margin: 0 0 var(--sp-2); }\n  .sea-rx__foot {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: var(--sp-3);\n    margin-block-start: auto;\n    padding-block-start: var(--sp-4);\n    border-block-start: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-border));\n  }\n  .sea-rx__form { margin: 0; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .sea-rx__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    .sea-rx__media img { transition: none; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"sea-rx\">\n  <div class=\"sea-rx__head title-wrapper leading-none flex flex-col gap-4 relative z-1\">\n    <div class=\"grid gap-4\">\n      <p class=\"heading normal-case font-medium subtext-lg leading-none tracking-none\">The autumn menu</p>\n      <h2 class=\"heading title-md\">Four dinners, and everything you need to cook them.</h2>\n      <div class=\"description rte leading-normal subtext-md\">\n        <p>Four beautiful dinners to celebrate the equinox, each written out step by step &mdash; with the seafood a click away.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  {%- capture card_sizes -%}(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw{%- endcapture -%}\n  {%- assign card_widths = '400,600,800,1000,1200' -%}\n\n  <div class=\"sea-rx__grid\">\n\n    {%- comment -%} ---------- Card 1: Whole roasted trout ---------- {%- endcomment -%}\n    <article class=\"sea-rx__card\">\n      <figure class=\"sea-rx__media\">\n        {%- assign img = images['20260825-Stetten-Wilson-219.jpg'] -%}\n        {%- if img != blank -%}{{ img | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: card_sizes, widths: card_widths, alt: 'Whole Roasted Trout with Blistered Grapes and Baby Potatoes' }}{%- endif -%}\n        {%- assign img = images['20260825-Stetten-Wilson-216.jpg'] -%}\n        {%- if img != blank -%}{{ img | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: card_sizes, widths: card_widths, alt: '', class: 'is-hover', aria-hidden: 'true' }}{%- endif -%}\n      </figure>\n      <div class=\"sea-rx__body\">\n        <h3 class=\"heading text-xl leading-tight\"><a class=\"reversed-link\" href=\"/blogs/seafood-recipes/whole-roasted-trout-blistered-grapes-potatoes\">Whole Roasted Trout with Blistered Grapes and Baby Potatoes</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"sea-rx__meta\">\n          <span class=\"badge font-medium leading-none rounded-full\">50 min</span>\n          <span class=\"badge font-medium leading-none rounded-full\">Serves 2</span>\n          <span class=\"badge font-medium leading-none rounded-full\">A confident first whole fish</span>\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"sea-rx__note text-opacity text-sm leading-normal\">One sheet pan. Potatoes get a head start, grapes go in last, and the fish comes off the bone in three movements.</p>\n        {%- assign p = all_products['whole-trout-12oz'] -%}\n        <div class=\"sea-rx__foot\">\n          {%- if p != blank and p.available -%}\n            {%- form 'product', p, id: 'rx-whole-trout-12oz', data-type: 'add-to-cart-form', class: 'sea-rx__form', is: 'product-form' -%}\n              <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"id\" value=\"{{ p.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}\">\n              <div class=\"product-form__error-message\" role=\"alert\" hidden></div>\n              <button type=\"submit\" name=\"add\" class=\"button button--primary button--sm product-form__submit\" is=\"hover-button\">\n                <span class=\"btn-fill\" data-fill></span>\n                <span class=\"btn-text\">Add the {{ p.title }}</span>\n              </button>\n            {%- endform -%}\n            <span class=\"text-opacity text-sm\">from {{ p.price_min | money }}</span>\n          {%- endif -%}\n          <a class=\"reversed-link font-medium text-sm\" href=\"/blogs/seafood-recipes/whole-roasted-trout-blistered-grapes-potatoes\">Full recipe &rarr;</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    {%- comment -%} ---------- Card 2: Butter pumpkin shrimp ---------- {%- endcomment -%}\n    <article class=\"sea-rx__card\">\n      <figure class=\"sea-rx__media\">\n        {%- assign img = images['20260825-Stetten-Wilson-112.jpg'] -%}\n        {%- if img != blank -%}{{ img | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: card_sizes, widths: card_widths, alt: 'Butter Pumpkin Shrimp with Toasted Coconut, Lime and Fresno' }}{%- endif -%}\n        {%- assign img = images['20260825-Stetten-Wilson-104.jpg'] -%}\n        {%- if img != blank -%}{{ img | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: card_sizes, widths: card_widths, alt: '', class: 'is-hover', aria-hidden: 'true' }}{%- endif -%}\n      </figure>\n      <div class=\"sea-rx__body\">\n        <h3 class=\"heading text-xl leading-tight\"><a class=\"reversed-link\" href=\"/blogs/seafood-recipes/butter-pumpkin-shrimp-curry\">Butter Pumpkin Shrimp with Toasted Coconut, Lime and Fresno</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"sea-rx__meta\">\n          <span class=\"badge font-medium leading-none rounded-full\">50 min</span>\n          <span class=\"badge font-medium leading-none rounded-full\">Serves 4</span>\n          <span class=\"badge font-medium leading-none rounded-full\">Family style, no technique</span>\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"sea-rx__note text-opacity text-sm leading-normal\">If you like butter chicken you will like this. The sauce is roasted squash through a blender, not an hour of reducing.</p>\n        {%- assign p = all_products['black-tiger-shrimp-mangrove-regeneration'] -%}\n        <div class=\"sea-rx__foot\">\n          {%- if p != blank and p.available -%}\n            {%- form 'product', p, id: 'rx-black-tiger-shrimp-mangrove-regeneration', data-type: 'add-to-cart-form', class: 'sea-rx__form', is: 'product-form' -%}\n              <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"id\" value=\"{{ p.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}\">\n              <div class=\"product-form__error-message\" role=\"alert\" hidden></div>\n              <button type=\"submit\" name=\"add\" class=\"button button--primary button--sm product-form__submit\" is=\"hover-button\">\n                <span class=\"btn-fill\" data-fill></span>\n                <span class=\"btn-text\">Add the {{ p.title }}</span>\n              </button>\n            {%- endform -%}\n            <span class=\"text-opacity text-sm\">from {{ p.price_min | money }}</span>\n          {%- endif -%}\n          <a class=\"reversed-link font-medium text-sm\" href=\"/blogs/seafood-recipes/butter-pumpkin-shrimp-curry\">Full recipe &rarr;</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    {%- comment -%} ---------- Card 3: Cider-poached steelhead ---------- {%- endcomment -%}\n    <article class=\"sea-rx__card\">\n      <figure class=\"sea-rx__media\">\n        {%- assign img = images['20260825-Stetten-Wilson-314.jpg'] -%}\n        {%- if img != blank -%}{{ img | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: card_sizes, widths: card_widths, alt: 'Apple Cider Poached Steelhead with Braised Leeks' }}{%- endif -%}\n        {%- assign img = images['20260825-Stetten-Wilson-316.jpg'] -%}\n        {%- if img != blank -%}{{ img | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: card_sizes, widths: card_widths, alt: '', class: 'is-hover', aria-hidden: 'true' }}{%- endif -%}\n      </figure>\n      <div class=\"sea-rx__body\">\n        <h3 class=\"heading text-xl leading-tight\"><a class=\"reversed-link\" href=\"/blogs/seafood-recipes/apple-cider-poached-steelhead-braised-leeks\">Apple Cider Poached Steelhead with Braised Leeks</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"sea-rx__meta\">\n          <span class=\"badge font-medium leading-none rounded-full\">45 min</span>\n          <span class=\"badge font-medium leading-none rounded-full\">Serves 2</span>\n          <span class=\"badge font-medium leading-none rounded-full\">Gentle, worth a thermometer</span>\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"sea-rx__note text-opacity text-sm leading-normal\">Held at 160 to 175&deg;F the loin stays silky rather than firming up. Brown butter and tarragon mustard to finish.</p>\n        {%- assign p = all_products['steelhead-sashimi-loin-12oz'] -%}\n        <div class=\"sea-rx__foot\">\n          {%- if p != blank and p.available -%}\n            {%- form 'product', p, id: 'rx-steelhead-sashimi-loin-12oz', data-type: 'add-to-cart-form', class: 'sea-rx__form', is: 'product-form' -%}\n              <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"id\" value=\"{{ p.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}\">\n              <div class=\"product-form__error-message\" role=\"alert\" hidden></div>\n              <button type=\"submit\" name=\"add\" class=\"button button--primary button--sm product-form__submit\" is=\"hover-button\">\n                <span class=\"btn-fill\" data-fill></span>\n                <span class=\"btn-text\">Add the {{ p.title }}</span>\n              </button>\n            {%- endform -%}\n            <span class=\"text-opacity text-sm\">from {{ p.price_min | money }}</span>\n          {%- endif -%}\n          <a class=\"reversed-link font-medium text-sm\" href=\"/blogs/seafood-recipes/apple-cider-poached-steelhead-braised-leeks\">Full recipe &rarr;</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    {%- comment -%} ---------- Card 4: Crispy branzino ---------- {%- endcomment -%}\n    <article class=\"sea-rx__card\">\n      <figure class=\"sea-rx__media\">\n        {%- assign img = images['20260825-Stetten-Wilson-245.jpg'] -%}\n        {%- if img != blank -%}{{ img | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: card_sizes, widths: card_widths, alt: 'Crispy Branzino with Warm Farro, Maitake and Asian Pear' }}{%- endif -%}\n        {%- assign img = images['20260825-Stetten-Wilson-242.jpg'] -%}\n        {%- if img != blank -%}{{ img | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', sizes: card_sizes, widths: card_widths, alt: '', class: 'is-hover', aria-hidden: 'true' }}{%- endif -%}\n      </figure>\n      <div class=\"sea-rx__body\">\n        <h3 class=\"heading text-xl leading-tight\"><a class=\"reversed-link\" href=\"/blogs/seafood-recipes/branzino-warm-farro-maitake-salad\">Crispy Branzino with Warm Farro, Maitake and Asian Pear</a></h3>\n        <p class=\"sea-rx__meta\">\n          <span class=\"badge font-medium leading-none rounded-full\">50 min</span>\n          <span class=\"badge font-medium leading-none rounded-full\">Serves 2</span>\n          <span class=\"badge font-medium leading-none rounded-full\">One technique to nail</span>\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"sea-rx__note text-opacity text-sm leading-normal\">Crisp skin is thirty seconds under a spatula. Better the next day, and good at room temperature.</p>\n        {%- assign p = all_products['branzino-bundle-2x-6oz-portions'] -%}\n        <div class=\"sea-rx__foot\">\n          {%- if p != blank and p.available -%}\n            {%- form 'product', p, id: 'rx-branzino-bundle-2x-6oz-portions', data-type: 'add-to-cart-form', class: 'sea-rx__form', is: 'product-form' -%}\n              <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"id\" value=\"{{ p.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}\">\n              <div class=\"product-form__error-message\" role=\"alert\" hidden></div>\n              <button type=\"submit\" name=\"add\" class=\"button button--primary button--sm product-form__submit\" is=\"hover-button\">\n                <span class=\"btn-fill\" data-fill></span>\n                <span class=\"btn-text\">Add the {{ p.title }}</span>\n              </button>\n            {%- endform -%}\n            <span class=\"text-opacity text-sm\">from {{ p.price_min | money }}</span>\n          {%- endif -%}\n          <a class=\"reversed-link font-medium text-sm\" href=\"/blogs/seafood-recipes/branzino-warm-farro-maitake-salad\">Full recipe &rarr;</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n  </div>\n</div>",
