    "image_with_text_UzFkDx": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_UR4q3M": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "A Centerpiece of Art: Apple Cider Poached Steelhead",
            "heading_size": "title-md",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_k3Bh9E": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Nothing says fall like apple cider and browned butter, and this dish has both. Poaching steelhead is a gentle way to prepare it, served here with plenty of good fat for a rounder, more satisfying bite. It feels like something you'd discover in a casual French kitchen, simple and elegant, and pairs beautifully with a few cheeses for dessert.</p>",
