            "title": "Dr. Kristyn Silver-Brook",
            "job": "Prenatal and postpartum chiropractor, mama, and a Seatopia customer",
            "Start_number": "5",
            "text": "<p>Thanks to SEATOPIA, throughout my pregnancy & while breastfeeding I've confidently enjoyed sushi-grade, mercury-free, omega-rich seafood from the comfort of home!</p>",
